Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.58,0:00:18.96,Top,,0,0,0,,The train will be arriving shortly. \NPlease stand behind the yellow line.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.92,0:00:35.16,Thought,,0,0,0,,I've hated winter ever since I was little. \NI hate the endless snow and the freezing wind.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.34,0:01:05.34,Thought,,0,0,0,,I was born with a disease
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.80,0:01:09.34,Thought,,0,0,0,,called HGS: High-Function Genetic Disorder.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for another injection.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.60,0:01:21.02,Thought,,0,0,0,,Piles of medication, \Nfrequent headaches and fevers...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.15,0:01:27.21,Thought,,0,0,0,,and a whole host of other health problems \Nand physical abnormalities.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.36,0:01:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, show us your wings one last time.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.07,0:01:37.37,Thought,,0,0,0,,And finally, these wings...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.37,0:01:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.08,0:01:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.83,0:01:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That wraps up today's \Nadjustment and examination.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Chika-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.17,0:01:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, about this data...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.35,0:01:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.47,0:01:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.68,0:01:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.48,0:02:03.61,Thought,,0,0,0,,There are a few other side effects.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.61,0:02:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Howdy! {[konni]chiwa [de]su?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.75,0:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mayuki-chan! \NPerfect timing.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.74,0:02:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We just finished.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.22,0:02:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.11,0:02:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sis.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.46,0:02:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up and get changed!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.09,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.20,0:02:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, she's still such a kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.12,0:02:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.02,0:02:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oopsy-daisy...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.27,0:02:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki-chan, you don't look so good. {complexion is bad}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.26,0:02:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.84,0:02:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, really?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.13,0:02:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I just haven't been sleeping much. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.26,0:02:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least living at Sazanami \Nmeans your nutrition's taken care of.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.36,0:02:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.71,0:02:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mayu.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.40,0:02:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.78,0:02:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be out in the yard.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.35,0:02:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Just don't catch a cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.51,0:02:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.40,0:02:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to say \Nshe's entered a stable phase.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.05,0:02:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A stable phase?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.57,0:03:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Her powers are still a little unstable, \Nbut I don't think she'll lose control like she used to.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.77,0:03:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.76,0:03:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Chika-chan settled down \Nbecause you were there for her.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.66,0:03:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.23,0:03:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.63,0:03:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to when she first came here, \Nshe's become a much brighter, happier girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.14,0:03:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure has.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.85,0:03:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-kun deserves some credit too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.16,0:03:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.19,0:03:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. There's something \NI'd like to ask Kosuke-kun and the others. {a favor}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.76,0:03:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.19,0:03:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,T1 Angel Breath.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.30,0:03:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.97,0:03:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone else with wings...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.97,0:04:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,especially with golden wings! {Chika doesn't have golden wings, Listhy's are the first she's seen}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.82,0:04:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Listhy Sinclair Crawford.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.42,0:04:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah? I'm Chika. Nimura Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.62,0:04:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.32,0:04:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.32,0:04:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.81,0:04:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.44,0:04:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the person \NI wanted to introduce you to.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.82,0:04:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.41,0:04:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name's Tora-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She's adorable.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.84,0:04:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She has the same genetic disorder as Chika \Nand she's being treated at our local hospital.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.39,0:04:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's new to Japan and has no family, \Nso Dr. Yazawa suggested our dorm.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.02,0:04:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.97,0:04:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-san, I've been cleaning the empty room \Nupstairs every day, so it's all ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.06,0:04:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. Then she can move in today. \NLet's get started.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.75,0:04:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Chika!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.24,0:04:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.48,0:05:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing... I just didn't expect \Neverything to come together so easily.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.82,0:05:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.64,0:05:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, ever since Kosuke showed up, everything around the dorm's been running so much smoother.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It really has.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.25,0:05:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You hardly ever see Chika-chan \Nand Mayuki-san looking lonely anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.64,0:05:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you fool! \NMaybe Chika, but I totally haven't changed! {lit: chika is one thing, but with me, it's your imagination}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.36,0:05:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai{-onee-chan}!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.16,0:05:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for letting Listhy stay here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.73,0:05:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.99,0:05:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Chika, why don't you show Listhy her room?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.64,0:05:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.47,0:05:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.56,0:05:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised to meet Minami-chan today.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.45,0:05:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you and Listhy go out together?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.30,0:05:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.29,0:05:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can show her around \NUminari Town while you're at it. {uminari = oceanic noise; rumbling of the sea; mistpouffer}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.58,0:05:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.07,0:05:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.71,0:05:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you're back for dinner!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.34,0:05:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! We're off, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.14,0:05:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.46,0:05:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.29,0:05:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.47,0:05:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.45,0:05:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You look pale.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.74,0:05:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm fine. Really!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.04,0:05:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been pushing yourself too hard with work.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.09,0:05:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.65,0:06:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I probably took on a few too many jobs, so I'm a little worn out.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.51,0:06:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how it goes. \NIt ain't easy being a popular manga artist.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.46,0:06:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, tomorrow's another deadline... \Nand the day after that too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.54,0:06:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke, make me something fancy \Nfor a late-night snack again!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.52,0:06:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.74,0:06:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami-chan's still not here. \NI guess we'll wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.46,0:06:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This way we'll stay warm.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.43,0:06:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so kind, Listhy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.14,0:06:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.23,0:06:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You are! You're a very kind person.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.33,0:06:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I like people like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.94,0:06:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Chika-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.06,0:06:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.19,0:07:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Yuuhi-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.98,0:07:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm meeting Minami-chan here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.10,0:07:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.70,0:07:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Listhy. She's going to be living with us for a while starting today.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.55,0:07:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya! I'm Shiina Yuuhi.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.17,0:07:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.24,0:07:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How old are you? \NDo you speak Japanese?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.20,0:07:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, your hair's silver!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.96,0:07:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.42,0:07:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some serious static electricity!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.67,0:07:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.06,0:07:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't treat her like a toy! Sorry, Listhy.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.39,0:07:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the bus is here. \NListhy, we'll chat more after we get home, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.73,0:07:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.92,0:07:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That electricity just now...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.39,0:07:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.22,0:07:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can do is move it around and shoot it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.62,0:07:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The nature of our powers \Nis something we're born with.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.79,0:07:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My genes convert my body's energy \Ninto electricity.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.09,0:08:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your genes chose to create wings of light, \Nregenerative abilities, and control over pure energy.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.80,0:08:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Healing quickly is pretty convenient, \Nbut I get fevers all the time, so it isn't all that great.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.06,0:08:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here. {issho = together}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.84,0:08:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.04,0:08:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My powers haven't really brought \Nme much happiness either.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.86,0:08:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard for both of us, having this disease.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.67,0:08:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend sure is taking a long time.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.44,0:08:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... She is.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.87,0:08:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.93,0:08:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Iena-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.43,0:08:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.47,0:08:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Quicker! Make your movements smoother! \NGet up on your feet!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.43,0:08:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.96,0:08:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.19,0:09:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! They're having a practice match.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.42,0:09:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Minami-chan's here. Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.81,0:09:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.53,0:09:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,60 to 62. Team A wins!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.72,0:09:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.42,0:09:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Weak! Way too weak!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.57,0:09:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate we can't retire with peace of mind!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.33,0:09:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You all need to work a lot harder!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.00,0:09:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough for today. \NClean up before you leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.21,0:09:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.60,0:09:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okamoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.63,0:09:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Taki-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.61,0:09:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still room for improvement, \Nbut you're all getting there.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.51,0:09:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really coming along too. {? idk why she calls her okamoto in person}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.79,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Taki-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.64,0:09:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.01,0:09:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for playing us!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.35,0:09:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.34,0:09:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.12,0:09:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami-chan, she praised you! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.62,0:09:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.69,0:09:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Iena-chan, your last pass was really good too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.61,0:09:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomo-chan, your three-pointer almost went in.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.03,0:09:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so? Yeah, next time \NI'm definitely making it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.34,0:09:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.99,0:10:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, the atmosphere's great! \NWe're getting there!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.95,0:10:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let's keep this up \Nuntil the closing ceremony!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.46,0:10:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.86,0:10:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami-chan, we're here! {??? sounds like some other person is saying aa kichatta but who could it be and why?}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.85,0:10:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Chika-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.37,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! We were supposed to meet up...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.64,0:10:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. You had a game today, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.90,0:10:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'll finish cleaning up really quick, so wait just a little!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.76,0:10:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. You don't have to rush.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.73,0:10:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be done in a jiffy, okay? Just wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.53,0:10:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The new girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.69,0:10:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Her name's Listhy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.82,0:10:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... I'm Okamoto Minami. \NNice to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.28,0:10:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.48,0:10:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about today, though. \NWe couldn't go shopping after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.58,0:10:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay. I got to watch \Nyour basketball game instead.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.70,0:10:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But we lost.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.51,0:10:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you all played your hearts out.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.34,0:10:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to make Rikako-san \Nand the others feel at ease. {probably the senpai-tachi they played against}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.80,0:10:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.44,0:10:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to show Rikako-san \Nand the others third-years, {added}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.64,0:11:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,that we're strong enough to win \Non our own even if they graduate.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.61,0:11:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But listen to me blowing all that hot air.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.24,0:11:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.10,0:11:11.10,Thought,,0,0,0,,Graduation, huh...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're home!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.82,0:11:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.31,0:11:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! That smells amazing! Kosuke-san, \Nwe're having white stew today, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.80,0:11:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullseye!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.29,0:11:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san, let me taste it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.53,0:11:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do our best!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.85,0:11:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.92,0:11:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{nyanda}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.11,0:11:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it out of the park,{kattobase} Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.55,0:11:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mio-chan! "Knock it out of the park" isn't the right cheer. This isn't baseball.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.36,0:11:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kaede. I mixed them up.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.10,0:11:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly... Watch this. \NI'll show you how it's done.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.69,0:11:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Yuuhi-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.84,0:11:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're all having fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.41,0:11:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are Kaede-chan and the others doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.52,0:11:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come join us, Chika-chan! \NWe're cheering Kaoru on for her entrance exams.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.10,0:11:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheering?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.15,0:11:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaoru fails, she'll have to go back to Kagoshima!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.62,0:12:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let that happen, \Nso we have to cheer her on!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.96,0:12:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, then we'd better give her our full support.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.32,0:12:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuuhi-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.46,0:12:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan, Kaede-chan,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.15,0:12:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you distracting Kaoru-san while she's...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.33,0:12:09.56,Overlap,,0,0,0,,We're not distracting her!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.56,0:12:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm sure Kaoru's happy about it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.46,0:12:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Still... Mayuki-san's working too...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.30,0:12:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Knock it off, you brats!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.05,0:12:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been pulling all-nighters trying to work here!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.26,0:12:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? But we're not forcing you to! {lit. But I'm not responsible for that (the all-nighters)}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.98,0:12:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you're sticking with that, huh?! {??? probably something to the effect of "you've got some guts"}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.89,0:12:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy there, Mayuki-san. Calm down.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.02,0:12:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.49,0:12:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.85,0:12:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.83,0:12:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki, knock it off! No violence!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.67,0:12:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.41,0:12:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.97,0:12:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,could you all please keep it down a little?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.30,0:12:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.63,0:12:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.34,0:12:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,See? It's all nice and tidy.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.52,0:12:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke cleans it every day.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.65,0:12:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need anything, just let me know.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.52,0:12:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... your medicine?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.99,0:13:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Apport? {https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apport_(paranormal)}\NImpressive! It only took you a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.72,0:13:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had lots of practice.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.39,0:13:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The oral meds are Type F, \NType S, and three kinds of EV.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.23,0:13:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The injectable ones are MR and ST-3.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.75,0:13:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You need more than I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.23,0:13:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.36,0:13:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,AS tablets.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.16,0:13:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.27,0:13:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you hate the side effects?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.09,0:13:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't be helped. They're the safest painkillers for nerve-related symptoms.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.67,0:13:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.79,0:13:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayu! Kaede's already given up! Let her go!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.48,0:13:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're next.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.90,0:13:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?! Kosuke! Kosuke! \NDo something about Mayu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.24,0:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki-san, go easy on her, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.75,0:13:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.30,0:13:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke, you traitor!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.43,0:13:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, tastes good.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.79,0:13:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That Mayu... When Dad gets back, \NI'm gonna have him punish her!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.28,0:13:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.17,0:13:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Keigo-san's coming back?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.90,0:14:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! R-Right! I forgot to tell you, Kosuke! \NDad's coming home for Christmas...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.40,0:14:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, how should I cook you?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.08,0:14:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me somebody!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.50,0:14:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hold still!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.08,0:14:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.16,0:14:10.13,Thought,,0,0,0,,Mio's father, Keigo-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.13,0:14:13.21,Thought,,0,0,0,,he was Sazanami's first dorm manager.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.80,0:14:16.84,Thought,,0,0,0,,I heard he's been overseas for work...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.48,0:14:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, your beer. {according to the subtitle on the right; not gonna make it as a sign because it's too inconspicuous and short}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.07,0:14:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.01,0:14:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Keigo-san, what will it be today?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.09,0:14:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking pork ramen, Kanna-san. {gyuuniku men}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.52,0:14:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And for you? {lit: Von-san, you?}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.41,0:14:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Same thing he got.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.60,0:14:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, two pork ramens it is, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.78,0:14:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what did you find out?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.47,0:14:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. That "Silver-Haired Devil." \NWe've got a lead on him.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.79,0:14:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.96,0:14:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Ray... \NNot her real name, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.89,0:15:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,She was on a flight from New Delhi to Narita.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.43,0:15:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm... {soudesuka...}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.58,0:15:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are there people in Japan who treat HGS users as nothing more than mercenaries or terrorists? {HGS能力者を傭兵かテロリストとしてしか扱わないようなやつらが、なんで日本に。。。}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.22,0:15:15.80,Thought,,0,0,0,,So my bad feeling was right after all. \NGood thing we acted first.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.80,0:15:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pork ramen.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.27,0:15:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.15,0:15:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon appétit.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.53,0:15:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.50,0:15:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanda-san, would you mind \Nclosing the shop starting tomorrow? {for a break}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.05,0:15:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was planning to come home for Christmas,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.95,0:15:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but some work suddenly came up in Japan, \Nso I thought I'd return a little earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.85,0:15:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If possible, I'd like you to...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.38,0:15:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,come back with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.13,0:15:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.38,0:15:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, everybody! We're taking a break starting tomorrow{ for a little while}, so today {I'm offering a huge sale—}everything is half off!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.84,0:15:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up, don't hold back! {lit: keep eating steadily}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.58,0:16:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.50,0:16:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.18,0:16:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.61,0:16:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold, and it's dangerous. Come down.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.83,0:16:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.01,0:16:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.34,0:16:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh... Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.00,0:16:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold dressed like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kosuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.82,0:16:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.37,0:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Smells wonderful.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.37,0:16:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Kaoru's studying's going okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.52,0:17:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm... probably.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.46,0:17:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru gets pretty nervous when it counts.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though she's so strong in matches.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.82,0:17:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's fine. \NIf she gives it her best, she'll pass.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.96,0:17:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.11,0:17:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.03,0:17:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Minami-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.40,0:17:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.12,0:17:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After graduation, will she end up \Ngoing to a school far away?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.23,0:17:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows? It sounds like she's gotten \Na few recommendation offers.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.53,0:17:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She says she wants to keep commuting \Nfrom here as long as it's possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.88,0:17:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe because she loves your cooking?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.14,0:17:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,More because her best friends are here.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.08,0:17:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.33,0:17:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's getting late, so off to bed.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.76,0:17:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.94,Thought,,0,0,0,,Good work today, Mayuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.86,0:18:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.53,0:18:08.57,Thought,,0,0,0,,No... It has been under control lately...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.76,0:18:18.16,Thought,,0,0,0,,The AS painkiller has one serious side effect.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.79,0:18:22.88,Thought,,0,0,0,,It acts on the nervous system\N and greatly amplifies certain urges.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.21,0:18:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.58,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.85,0:18:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.36,0:19:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.79,0:19:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,T-This side effect...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.88,0:19:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.75,0:19:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{?}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.32,0:19:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.81,0:20:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.32,0:20:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.82,0:21:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.68,0:21:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.10,0:21:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.56,0:21:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.45,0:22:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! {???????}{sore!}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.91,0:22:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.80,0:22:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:36.34,0:22:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:39.07,0:22:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's watching.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.22,0:22:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:41.40,0:22:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:42.10,0:22:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep looking, \Nyou'll end up like that girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:44.55,0:22:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll stay there forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.01,0:22:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Forever?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:48.44,0:22:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She won't ever come out of that warehouse
Dialogue: 10,0:22:51.33,0:22:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what's best for this house and for her.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:55.00,0:22:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.30,0:24:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.14,0:24:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tora-chan? What's wrong? Hungry?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:13.52,0:24:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Honestly, Tora-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:21.61,0:24:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sazanami Girls' Dorm.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.57,0:24:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kanna-san? Long time no talk!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.49,0:24:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Chika-chan? Long time no talk. \NHow is everybody?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:29.30,0:24:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're all doing great.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:31.18,0:24:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? That's good to know.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:32.87,0:24:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, something came up \Nand I suddenly have to go back to Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:36.23,0:24:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:36.82,0:24:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be there before Christmas, \Nor on Christmas Day itself by latest,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:40.08,0:24:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be coming back to Sazanami.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:41.41,0:24:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.50,0:24:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, and tell Kosuke-kun I need to talk to him \Nabout something important.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:46.84,0:24:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry! My ride's here.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:48.78,0:24:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone I said hello. Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.66,0:24:51.16,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Ah, wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.48,0:25:03.79,Thought,,0,0,0,,Tora-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:04.74,0:25:06.84,Thought,,0,0,0,,I wonder what this important talk is.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:06.84,0:25:10.45,Thought,,0,0,0,,When Kanna-san comes back, \Nwhat's going to happen to Kosuke?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:10.45,0:25:15.14,Thought,,0,0,0,,Is Kanna-san going to take over as manager again, \Nand Kosuke's going to leave?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.14,0:25:19.78,Thought,,0,0,0,,I don't want that... \NI absolutely don't want that. I don't!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:27.38,0:25:31.09,Thought,,0,0,0,,I've hated winter ever since I was little.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:31.09,0:25:35.05,Thought,,0,0,0,,I hate the endless falling snow \Nand the freezing wind.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:36.48,0:25:37.68,Thought,,0,0,0,,I hate winter...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:38.35,0:25:41.19,Thought,,0,0,0,,because it always feels like \Nsomeone's about to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:49.07,0:25:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Have you confirmed the target?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:51.38,0:25:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We have. However, we've run \Ninto an unexpected complication.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:55.12,0:25:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:57.16,0:25:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, relax. That's hardly worth worrying about.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:59.74,0:26:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:01.08,0:26:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The T1 Angel Breath genetic model.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:04.47,0:26:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the valuable specimen we want. \NA few additional sacrifices are an acceptable price.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:17.61,0:26:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's almost your time to act, {turn to appear}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:21.48,0:26:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Ray.
